    "description": "If cost per gram matters more than the sweetener, Gold Standard delivers about 24 g of protein per scoop for roughly 120 calories, per the label at the time of writing, at a fraction of Legion's cost per 25 g. Optimum Nutrition states it is Informed Choice certified. Most flavors use artificial sweeteners, which is the trade-off.",
