          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Legion Whey+ better than Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It has a cleaner label, with Irish grass-fed whey isolate and stevia instead of sucralose, but Gold Standard gives slightly more protein per scoop for far less money and states Informed Choice certification. Choose Legion if natural sweeteners matter to you; choose Gold Standard if cost per gram matters more."
