                  Yes, for recreational lifters who want natural sweeteners. Legion Whey+ provides 22 g of Irish grass-fed whey isolate protein in about 100 calories with stevia instead of sucralose. It is not NSF Certified for Sport, and at about $2.50 per 25 g of protein it costs more than mainstream wheys and slightly more than Transparent Labs.
