          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Legion makes clean, honestly sweetened protein with well-chosen sources, and Whey+ is a genuinely good grass-fed isolate: 22 g of protein in about 100 calories, stevia instead of sucralose, and a guarantee that removes most of the risk of trying it. What it lacks is a sport certification and a price edge, at roughly $2.50 per 25 g of protein.
          </p>
